I don't know, while I was spacing out, apparently something was there.

1221
00:45:50,205 --> 00:45:50,838
うん
Yeah.

1222
00:45:50,872 --> 00:45:52,272
じゃあバンシーなんじゃない？
Then isn't it a Banshee?

1223
00:45:51,372 --> 00:45:53,672
マジで見逃したんだけど！えぇ？！
I totally missed it! What?!

1224
00:45:53,938 --> 00:45:55,838
ドッツ映ってたの？
