Eh, apparently it showed up again! Hey, apparently it showed up again, Kyoko. Did you notice- did you notice?

1248
00:46:44,072 --> 00:46:46,472
嘘だよ！映ってないよ、なんにも！
No way! There's nothing on screen!

1249
00:46:46,272 --> 00:46:48,072
え、今も映ったってコメントいるよ
Eh, there's comments saying it just showed up!

1250
00:46:48,072 --> 00:46:49,272
嘘だー
Lieees!

1251
00:46:48,372 --> 00:46:51,672
「画面見てもろて」だって。わしでも見えなかったよ。
They're like, "Look at the screen." But I couldn't see it either.

1252
00:46:51,572 --> 00:46:53,372
え？ え、じゃあちょっと見とこっか
Eh? Eh, then let's watch for a bit.

1253
00:46:53,072 --> 00:46:55,772
え、じゃ、今、今見とくか。ちょ、流石にね。
Eh, then let's watch it now. Just, for real.

1254
00:46:56,072 --> 00:46:56,738
うん
Yeah.

1255
