I was so absorbed in chatting with Kyoko, but apparently if we don't watch, it just disappears, so this is bad.

1257
00:46:59,405 --> 00:47:00,405
あ、そうしよ
Ah, let's do that.

1258
00:47:05,772 --> 00:47:09,972
え、え、じゃあちゃんと見てさ、ドッツの使い方を学ぼうか
