無理なのかな、うちら？
Is it impossible for us?

1274
00:47:41,872 --> 00:47:43,672
無理かー
Impossible, huh...

1275
00:47:43,772 --> 00:47:44,772
え、もう...
Eh, already...

1276
00:47:44,072 --> 00:47:46,072
え、のじゃあ、見たいよ！
Eh, Noja-a, I want to see it!

1277
