1278
00:47:51,572 --> 00:47:53,072
見てると映らない？
It doesn't show when we look?

1279
00:47:52,072 --> 00:47:54,072
え、もういっか、映んないし！
Eh, whatever, it's not showing up anyway!

1280
00:47:53,372 --> 00:47:56,072
もう、もうバンシーってことにする？
Should we just, just call it a Banshee?

1281
