1381
00:51:09,080 --> 00:51:11,280
使えないアイテムだから。
Because it's a useless item.

1382
00:51:10,880 --> 00:51:11,380
うん。
Yeah.

1383
00:51:11,280 --> 00:51:13,280
甘え甘え。これ持ってるのは甘え、マジで。
Total crutch. Seriously, carrying it is just being spoiled.

1384
00:51:12,980 --> 00:51:13,680
うん。
Yeah.

1385
00:51:14,380 --> 00:51:16,880
