Tomorrow is the ASOBI☆MAWARI-TAI! collab.

2976
01:54:33,876 --> 01:54:37,876
明日はアソビ★まわり隊！コラボ！ 頑張りますのじゃー！
Tomorrow is the ASOBI☆MAWARI-TAI! collab! We'll do our best!

2977
01:54:37,976 --> 01:54:47,076
それでは、お主ら、さらばじゃーのじゃー！
With that said, everyone, farewell to you all!

2978
01:54:50,176 --> 01:55:00,176
